SCOPE

The licence above covers the contents of this repository: the host application
(`src/`), the tooling (`scripts/`, `extract_assets.bat`, `mac-build/`), the
codegen inputs (`*.toml`), the build files, and the documentation.

It does NOT cover, and this project does not grant any rights to:

  * Mushihimesama Futari, its code, data, audio, or artwork. All rights are
    owned by Cave Interactive Co., Ltd. No game content is distributed here.
  * The recompiled C++ under `generated/`. That is a machine translation of the
    game's own executable code, produced on your machine from a copy you own.
    It is a derivative of Cave's copyrighted work, not of this repository, and
    it is neither distributed here nor licensed by this file.
  * `screenshots/title.png`, a screenshot of the game, included for
    identification purposes only.

The ReXGlue SDK (`thirdparty/rexglue-sdk`) is a separate project under its own
BSD 3-Clause licence, and is itself derived from the Xenia project
(Copyright (c) 2022, Ben Vanik and Xenia project contributors).
